{"id":"1dd4e0126608292d","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Variance Functional","display":"df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional — ZFC Prob2 Variance Functional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional — ZFC Prob2 Variance Functional","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-variance-functional — ZFC Prob2 Variance Functional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,X,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,m,Y\\in V\">\\(v,X,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,m,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>（实数上的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (expectation-value and set-function predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2VarianceFunctional}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2VarianceFunctional}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}variance\\text{-}functional} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2VarianceFunctional}_S(v,X,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nv\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,m,Y\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land\nm\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(m,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(Y,\\Omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(Y(\\xi)=(X(\\xi)-m)^2\\bigr)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(v,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}variance\\text{-}functional} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2VarianceFunctional}_S(v,X,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nv\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,m,Y\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land\nm\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(m,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(Y,\\Omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(Y(\\xi)=(X(\\xi)-m)^2\\bigr)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(v,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both expectations are supplied by the fully parameterized upstream value predicate. The squared centered random variable is an explicit set function, rather than an unsourced expression inside an expectation operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3$（参数顺序为 $(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$，see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)$（实数上的 Borel $\\sigma$-代数，see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable","status":"resol